{"source": "side_04.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.38, "text": "You waste the morning.", "words": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 0.38, "w": " You", "p": 0.83}, {"s": 0.38, "e": 0.72, "w": " waste", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 0.72, "e": 1.0, "w": " the", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 1.0, "e": 1.38, "w": " morning.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 1.92, "end": 4.04, "text": "Then you decide the whole day is ruined.", "words": [{"s": 1.92, "e": 2.08, "w": " Then", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 2.08, "e": 2.24, "w": " you", "p": 0.97}, {"s": 2.24, "e": 2.56, "w": " decide", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 2.56, "e": 2.8, "w": " the", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 2.8, "e": 3.2, "w": " whole", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.2, "e": 3.48, "w": " day", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.48, "e": 3.74, "w": " is", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 3.74, "e": 4.04, "w": " ruined.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 4.5, "end": 6.64, "text": "So you put everything off until tomorrow.", "words": [{"s": 4.5, "e": 4.64, "w": " So", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 4.64, "e": 4.78, "w": " you", "p": 0.91}, {"s": 4.78, "e": 5.08, "w": " put", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 5.08, "e": 5.54, "w": " everything", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 5.54, "e": 5.84, "w": " off", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 5.84, "e": 6.12, "w": " until", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 6.12, "e": 6.64, "w": " tomorrow.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 7.14, "end": 9.02, "text": "But you've still got a few hours left.", "words": [{"s": 7.14, "e": 7.28, "w": " But", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 7.28, "e": 7.56, "w": " you've", "p": 0.97}, {"s": 7.56, "e": 7.76, "w": " still", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 7.76, "e": 7.96, "w": " got", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 7.96, "e": 8.1, "w": " a", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.1, "e": 8.24, "w": " few", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.24, "e": 8.54, "w": " hours", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 8.54, "e": 9.02, "w": " left.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 9.54, "end": 12.12, "text": "You could still do one thing you meant to do,", "words": [{"s": 9.54, "e": 9.78, "w": " You", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 9.78, "e": 10.08, "w": " could", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.08, "e": 10.38, "w": " still", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.38, "e": 10.7, "w": " do", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 10.7, "e": 11.0, "w": " one", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 11.0, "e": 11.22, "w": " thing", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.22, "e": 11.38, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.38, "e": 11.54, "w": " meant", "p": 0.98}, {"s": 11.54, "e": 11.74, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 11.74, "e": 12.12, "w": " do,", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 12.36, "end": 13.96, "text": "even if it's only for 20 minutes.", "words": [{"s": 12.36, "e": 12.58, "w": " even", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 12.58, "e": 12.72, "w": " if", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 12.72, "e": 12.88, "w": " it's", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 12.88, "e": 13.1, "w": " only", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 13.1, "e": 13.34, "w": " for", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 13.34, "e": 13.58, "w": " 20", "p": 0.91}, {"s": 13.58, "e": 13.96, "w": " minutes.", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 14.42, "end": 15.82, "text": "It won't give you the morning back,", "words": [{"s": 14.42, "e": 14.58, "w": " It", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.58, "e": 14.82, "w": " won't", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.82, "e": 14.92, "w": " give", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 14.92, "e": 15.08, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.08, "e": 15.22, "w": " the", "p": 0.99}, {"s": 15.22, "e": 15.44, "w": " morning", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 15.44, "e": 15.82, "w": " back,", "p": 1.0}]}, {"start": 16.22, "end": 18.12, "text": "but you don't have to waste the evening too.", "words": [{"s": 16.22, "e": 16.4, "w": " but", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.4, "e": 16.54, "w": " you", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.54, "e": 16.72, "w": " don't", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.72, "e": 16.92, "w": " have", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 16.92, "e": 17.08, "w": " to", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.08, "e": 17.26, "w": " waste", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.26, "e": 17.52, "w": " the", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.52, "e": 17.78, "w": " evening", "p": 1.0}, {"s": 17.78, "e": 18.12, "w": " too.", "p": 0.44}]}]}